Scope note:

The MIT license above applies to the original work in this repository —
the regression harness (tests/regression.sh, update.sh), documentation
(README.md, CUSTOMIZATIONS.md, tests/README.md), and the customizations
that transform the upstream Brother Speedio post into its "modified"
form (the diff between upstream/*.cps and modified/*.cps).

Third-party material included in this repository remains under its own
terms:

- upstream/*.cps — vanilla Brother Speedio post processor from Autodesk,
  Copyright (C) Autodesk, Inc. The "modified" variants are derivative
  works of this upstream; use is subject to Autodesk's terms for their
  post processor library (https://cam.autodesk.com/hsmposts).
- tests/fixtures/Milling/* and tests/fixtures/Probing/* — CNC fixtures
  copied from Autodesk's cam-posteditor extension, Copyright (c) 2017
  Autodesk, Inc., redistributed under MIT. See tests/fixtures/LICENSE.
